          "exact_section": "247 CMR 9.23(5)(a)-(d) (temporary absence of a Manager of Record: 30-day threshold, five-day unplanned appointment, pre-absence controlled substances inventory and its substitute performer, 100-day change application)",
          "checked_date": "2026-09-11"
